msgid "Using a Battery Monitor to Report Fuel Flow and Consumption"
msgstr "使用电池监测器报告燃油流量和消耗"

#: ../../source/docs/common-efi.rst:100 ../../source/docs/common-efi.rst:101
#: 3b12d84faa724d468d026f73dacdd8ee 723560977ace44b493f2c877aeb50469
msgid ""
"If an EFI is used in the system, either thru a LUA driver or the built-in "
"drivers above, the fuel flow and consumption can be monitored using "
":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 27. The fuel flow in liters/hour will be"
" reported as amps, while the fuel consumed in milliliters will be reported "
"as mah."
msgstr ""
"如果系统中使用了 EFI（无论是通过 LUA 驱动还是上述内置驱动），可以使用 :ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = "
"27 来监测燃油流量和消耗。燃油流量（升/小时）将以安培报告，而燃油消耗（毫升）将以 mah 报告。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-efi.rst:102 ../../source/docs/common-efi.rst:103
#: 0f761e7941db4ef48776d09e991ea016 6f877f5636d74e2bad272ecfc80853ed
msgid ""
"the MAVLink command to reset the fuel consumed does not work with this "
"monitor."
msgstr "重置已消耗燃油的 MAVLink 命令不适用于此监测器。"

